# Bramble Isles: a collect-a-thon 3D platformer invented as a genre example. No game's names,
# data or logic. A hub island opens five worlds as the player gathers lucky marbles; every world
# hides marbles behind moves, and is scattered with minor collectibles (seed pods) everywhere.
# The worlds share one shape, so `worlds.rando` writes it once over tables of worlds and marbles.
world bramble_isles "Bramble Isles" version 1
use items
use hub
use worlds
start hub_meadow

# Lucky marbles the summit door wants.
option marbles_for_summit: range 15..30 = 25
# Seed pods per world that are checks. Every world has eight; the rest stay where they are.
option pods_per_world: range 2..8 = 6

goal summit_reached
